    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0007:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0007",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For a PEM-encoded public-key certificate stored in the file `ca.pem`, you can calculate the [`SPKI-SHA256-BASE64`](information-property-list/nspinnedcaidentities/spki-sha256-base64.md) value with the following `openssl` commands:",
      "normalizedSource": "For a PEM-encoded public-key certificate stored in the file `ca.pem`, you can calculate the [`SPKI-SHA256-BASE64`](information-property-list/nspinnedcaidentities/spki-sha256-base64.md) value with the following `openssl` commands:",
      "sourceHash": "2fb6dbd612d195385dfded3bcd21aa27e60888818645e13fd16985a098aa0b84",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "You represent a pinned certificate using the Base64-encoded SHA-256 digest of an X.509 certificate’s DER-encoded ASN.1 Subject Public Key Info (SPKI) structure.",
      "contextAfter": "```sh\n% cat ca.pem |\n      openssl x509 -inform pem -noout -outform pem -pubkey |\n      openssl pkey -pubin -inform pem -outform der |\n      openssl dgst -sha256 -binary |\n      openssl enc -base64\n```",
      "documentTitle": "SPKI-SHA256-BASE64",
      "framework": "BundleResources",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0008",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```sh\n% cat ca.pem |\n      openssl x509 -inform pem -noout -outform pem -pubkey |\n      openssl pkey -pubin -inform pem -outform der |\n      openssl dgst -sha256 -binary |\n      openssl enc -base64\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```sh % cat ca.pem | openssl x509 -inform pem -noout -outform pem -pubkey | openssl pkey -pubin -inform pem -outform der | openssl dgst -sha256 -binary | openssl enc -base64 ```",
      "sourceHash": "6d0893f8deef7c32e247abbcd0099d3c0a8f58067601466a556526e65f61a68d",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "For a PEM-encoded public-key certificate stored in the file `ca.pem`, you can calculate the [`SPKI-SHA256-BASE64`](information-property-list/nspinnedcaidentities/spki-sha256-base64.md) value with the following `openssl` commands:",
      "contextAfter": "---",
      "documentTitle": "SPKI-SHA256-BASE64",
      "framework": "BundleResources",
      "ko": "```sh\n% cat ca.pem |\n      openssl x509 -inform pem -noout -outform pem -pubkey |\n      openssl pkey -pubin -inform pem -outform der |\n      openssl dgst -sha256 -binary |\n      openssl enc -base64\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": true
    },
